<overview>
<p>Conventional infantry within the DCMS serve as the foundation of planetary defense, providing the manpower essential to territorial control while freeing BattleMech and armored assets for offensive operations. The platoon operates a light autocannon in a compact mounting designed to minimize the logistical burden on the formation. Less powerful than standard field guns, it still gives the platoon direct fire capability against armored targets that personal weapons cannot touch.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on common production date of light autocannon
</notes>

